{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：10:00 2026-09-16 HKT</p>\n\n<p>前TVB「師奶殺手」吳啟華與內地前妻石揚子的女兒吳熙兒，轉眼即將迎來18歲成人禮，她於2024年國中畢業後便遠赴加拿大升學，日前罕有曝光最新近照，旋即在網絡掀起熱話。繼承了星級父母優良基因的吳熙兒，如今早已褪去小時候的稚氣，長得亭亭玉立，憑藉出眾的清冷氣質與精緻五官，被網民力讚是「最美星二代」。</p>\n<h2>吳啟華女兒遺傳父母優良基因</h2>\n<p>從曝光的近照可見，即將成年的吳熙兒外形極為吸睛，身材修長纖瘦，手長腳長，擁有超模的身材比例，舉手投足星味十足。在五官輪廓上，她完美復刻父親吳啟華外貌，擁有筆挺的鼻樑，瓜子口臉，一雙靈動大眼更隱約流露出文藝氣質，網民紛紛讚她的高顏值可以原地出道。</p>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒小時候。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb63da47d1d9aaaac11230b1f056d62d/2023-01/NGWA.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒吳熙兒童年時已經好靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa176a9c317598084972d0b6bec96423/2023-01/NGWA2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小時候已經有氣質。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6afe241bcd9160221602f021e885f3de/2023-01/NGWA3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒吳熙兒氣質高雅，擁有精緻立體的五官。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d67674af2e390cd831ab6e7aef38d35d/2026-09/00a1pOY7gy1ih427i2wapj30yi0k4gnf_0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8405ea130bc5acb3e0cc8756e3a612a5/2026-09/00a1pOY7gy1ih427ie14tj30s20y2tcw_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近日吳熙兒戴上墨鏡，以全黑斜肩上衣配搭寬鬆長褲，在街頭隨性一站已星味十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a753787d2e470c3adf73654636798632/2026-09/00a1pOY7gy1ih427iwe04j30qe0xsn04_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"完美復刻爸爸吳啟華的帥氣基因，吳熙兒展現高級「厭世臉」直逼超模。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f2863da02b0d45c6c59c7c482413604/2026-09/00a1pOY7gy1ih427j8zc3j30tq0ye0wt_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒吳熙兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13ee82b933a8dc3e14ad341f0068ecb5/2023-01/NGWA24.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒擁有標緻五官。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/545859f4d5500f93ad9eaa372d8a8889/2023-01/NGWA23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒散發少女味！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/128f9845d51c2578f075670acbae4c75/2023-01/NGWA22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒好有氣質。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8255255a23da9694fbff236bdf28df39/2023-01/NGWA21.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒被封最美星二代。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad36494846b29ea1d8bd350c1cc5aef0/2023-01/NGWA20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華廚藝不俗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/411297c49550293685bafaa52d6c6f7d/2023-11/cap_40.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華早前頻頻拍片教煮食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16141b1f23f111f2e8cc41bfc6106728/2024-02/1_6_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華疑於自己豪宅內拍片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f087bb09f30b99559564fadc604f9cef/2024-02/2_10_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華早前於尖沙咀被內地粉絲捕獲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a558438ffcfb5d964661ccd06d8ed3a/2025-07/1_0_36.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華的連串表情成為討論焦點。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce8d39e832f20bf869912b0bcf3d5907/2025-07/2_0_36.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲向吳啟華送贈精美禮物，十分有心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33a9627cd2eca99293bbaf37432448b0/2025-07/3_74.jpg\"/>\n<h2>吳啟華女兒曾晒名袋被指炫富</h2>\n<p>吳啟華女兒吳熙兒自小熱愛打扮，穿搭風格一向走在潮流尖端。2023年她赴日旅行時大晒修長美腿，因手挽價值約30萬港元的Hermès Birkin Cargo 25限量版手袋而引發全網轟動，平日私服亦常見 Chanel、Gucci 等頂級奢牌，一度被網民狠批年紀輕輕「炫富」。如今留學海外的她，打扮更顯隨性自信，簡約貼身露腰裝展露纖細小蠻腰，將高䠷身材展現得淋漓盡致。</p>\n<h2>網民讚吳熙兒可原地出道</h2>\n<p>回顧吳啟華的感情路，他歷經兩段婚姻，1992年與泰國富家千金Varintra結婚、1995年離婚，其後於2007年迎娶石揚子並育有吳熙兒，可惜婚姻於2014年告終。多年來吳啟華對女兒寵愛有加，全力資助她赴加拿大求學。吳熙兒憑藉驚艷外形與星二代光環，未來的演藝潛力備受看好。</p>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒分享了多張靚相，早已是小美人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b80b469a789480f5aaf90cb4e11699ff/2023-01/NGWA4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒吳熙兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/09b011c106d13fdc91fdd01bd8fa66c3/2023-01/NGWA5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒露出纖腰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9cba72f7658c97841b597064507c340c/2023-01/NGWA6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒身材修長。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e2f0413d0158473bfdeb7a03cbf1878/2023-01/NGWA7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒是吳啟華與第二任妻子石揚子所生的女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f47fd0889de40c811005956285797198/2023-01/NGWA8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒（右）已經亭亭玉立。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/490ba8abaa471262df2ea2794fa1a1eb/2023-01/NGWA9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒擁有尖臉高鼻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90ca43f536bd64df1e5808760d893994/2023-01/NGWA10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒好有氣質。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11cede93cd4c688fadb7458e13eb2f49/2023-01/NGWA11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"跟小時候樣子相比更清秀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/30c2b55e1dadc4b8fa958b39abcd114e/2023-01/NGWA12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒吳熙兒就讀國際學校。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b738bb11abebf08a87146fbb9afbe2e/2023-01/NGWA13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒好可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb7f65976b7f213c7c6a6b8c613e8566/2023-01/NGWA15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒吳熙兒不時分享生活照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e90fa449d1d554e84ea75c7e76216253/2023-01/NGWA16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒現時與外婆同住。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e4e3f34a490e719ef1b6d95ed7d6404/2023-01/NGWA17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒吳熙兒外貌早熟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f08456ffc997ea7b6f316e4029337bc5/2023-01/NGWA18.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒有點似炎明熹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a05215c87511b8bbd19b483e7906c9da/2023-01/NGWA19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒身材不俗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c87306a4e31a17b1567c090aab03d89/2023-01/NGWA35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒好清秀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c95a13f6ff695e1a37fe2e8e569a068/2023-01/NGWA34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒皮膚好白淨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e2264fd3d8775ffb74f177b54e07d89/2023-01/NGWA32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳熙兒是吳啟華與第二任妻子石揚子的女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92737d5dac4dcfd7f918d997fe28a073/2023-01/NGWA29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒去年14歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15701c952d4e1fe3ea8a071b6e9d733a/2023-01/NGWA28.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳啟華女兒擁有尖臉高鼻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8353191feab0cbcbf1c8f494afa3292/2023-01/NGWA26.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T02:24:38.836464+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":657,"images":39,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}